  "description": "Waking up as their favorite character's wife is every fangirl's dream, and that's exactly what happened to Rowena Hadelus! Does it matter that she's a villainess destined to get divorced and die a horrible death? Not at all! Her task is simple—make her husband fall in love with her. However, what she thinks will be an easy mission is quickly turned upside down as events not mentioned in the original story begin unfolding. Will Rowena be able to secure the happy ending she dreams of?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
